  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3009.01 Violations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3009.01 Violations. The director shall issue a notice of violation and an order of abatement, which may be appealed in accordance with Env-A 200, establishing a compliance schedule with which the Generator and user source shall comply whenever the director finds that a person who has been issued an ERC has violated:\n\n(a) The provisions of this chapter;\n\n(b) Any rules in force hereunder; or\n\n(c) Any condition of an ERC certificate issued hereunder, including such conditions incorporated into permits issued by the division or EPA.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
}
